target
# `target` above is unanchored, so it also hides a **source** directory of that
# name; STYLE.md §2.9 puts `redirect::open::target`'s submodules in exactly such
# a directory, and an ignored file is silently dropped from the nix build
# (AGENTS.md). Re-include this one path.
!safe/fdshell/src/redirect/open/target/
result
*.profraw
PLAN.md
/mutants.out*
.opencode/goals
__pycache__/
node_modules/

# Test artifacts a run aborted before cleanup can leave in the fdshell crate
# root (task #476): these paths must never be committed. Anchored on the crate
# root so they can never hide a source file elsewhere (see `target` caveat
# above) — an ignored file silently drops from the nix build.
safe/fdshell/0
safe/fdshell/&1
safe/fdshell/fdshell-sock-*
safe/fdshell/async-*
safe/fdshell/sync-*
